# Ignore rules for the Lambda image build.
#
# This file is NOT in the repo root on purpose. BuildKit resolves `<dockerfile-path>.dockerignore`
# first and only falls back to a context-root `.dockerignore`, so keeping it here honours the root
# cap in CLAUDE.md while still applying to a build whose context is the repo root.
#
# Everything the image does not need is excluded rather than enumerated by inclusion, because a
# missed exclusion costs image size and a missed inclusion costs a runtime ImportError. What is being
# defended is cold-start latency, not the 250MB zip limit — see the note in the runtime stage.

.git
.github
.venv
venv

docs
infra
web
tests

.mypy_cache
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
dist
build
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info

# Never let credentials or local state near a build context.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
**/.terraform

private
data
Makefile
